  "historyNote": "#9073, INTERIM, eff 1-17-08; ss by #9614, eff 12-12-09; ss by #12574, eff 9-1-18; ss by #12574, eff 9-1-18; ss by #13498, eff 12-1-22 (formerly Puc 1304.02) (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Puc 1300)",
